# Innocent Blood while the caster controls no creature: "each player" includes the caster, who has nothing to sacrifice,
# and the opponent still sacrifices their only creature (no choice, so no question). The spell does not need the caster to
# have a creature, and it has no target.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Innocent Blood
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Innocent Blood.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp
Bot1.Graveyard = Innocent Blood
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
